      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GLACIAL FIRE (7) returned from a 49-week spell last start with a most impressive second over 1300m at Balaklava, leading until the final bounds. Won't mind the extra trip and with loads of natural improvement to come she looks the goods. RED RIPPLES (3) continues to race well but is no closer to a win. Made good late inroads to get up for fourth last time out over today's course and distance. Blinkers on for the first time might be the circuit breaker. THE BLACK HARP (5) got moving when the race was all over first-up over 1250m at Morphettville Parks. The step up in distance makes him a key runner. JUST COMET (8) recorded her third minor placing from six starts when a closing third over 1350m at Strathalbyn recently. Can play a role on the quick back-up. SHOGUN CHIKARA (4) is a half-brother to Group 3 winner Exotic Ruby on debut. Looks to have his share of talent judging on a recent jump-out win.",
